## Testing

Run the automated test suite:
```bash
python -m pytest -v
```

Run UI smoke tests:
```bash
python scratch/smoke_test_remap_ui.py
python scratch/smoke_test_hall_ui.py
python scratch/smoke_test_dks_ui.py
python scratch/smoke_test_settings_ui.py
```

